                <invention-title lang="de">ADAPTIVE BESTIMMUNG VON KOMFORTGERÄUSCHPARAMETERN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DÉTERMINATION ADAPTATIVE DE PARAMÈTRE DE BRUIT DE CONFORT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ADAPTIVE COMFORT NOISE PARAMETER DETERMINATION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for generating a comfort noise (CN) parameter for a multichannel audio signal is provided. The method includes detecting an inactive segment in the multichannel audio signal and calculating a weighted average of the CN parameter for a first silence descriptor, SID, frame of the inactive segment and providing the weighted average of CN parameter to a decoder.</p>
            </abstract>
